==Battleground==
*50 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~4 seconds<sup>100f~120f</sup>.
*50 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6~33.33 seconds<sup>180f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*50 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.
*50 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.
*6 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*6 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[Oldhorn]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the Oldhorn with [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] and other heavy hitters like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] while also using [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling]] to chip at Director Kurosawah. Once the Oldhorn dies, rush down Kurosawah with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[talents|talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T]] and other heavy hitters.

